[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6252.31, "timestamp": "01:44:12", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6253.43, "timestamp": "01:44:13", "text": "好吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6264.709, "timestamp": "01:44:24", "text": "我只能用毛巾擦乾。半天之內它就乾了，很明顯。之後，Astra 就不是 Astra 了。搞什麼鬼？ Jo 沒用臉部追蹤。我叫他 Astra"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6285.189, "timestamp": "01:44:45", "text": "。哇。好吧。嗯，那"}]